---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Imagile is Sunny Kolattukudy — a solo, senior-led practice built on a decade of engineering, a stint in medicine, and a metal band.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <Hero
      eyebrow="About"
      title="Imagile is <em>Sunny Kolattukudy.</em>"
      subtitle="No team page, because there's no team to page. One staff-level engineer, ten-plus years in, doing the work himself."
      size="md"
      showMark={false}
    />

    <section class="section about">
      <div class="container about__inner">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            I started in medicine — Case Western Reserve University and the Cleveland Clinic Lerner College of
            Medicine. That chapter wasn't really about becoming a doctor, in the end. It was about learning to help
            people well: understand the problem fully before you act on it, and know that getting it wrong has real
            consequences for real people. That standard stuck with me longer than the coursework did.
          </p>
          <p>
            Somewhere in the middle of that I co-founded <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@DEADIRONvideos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Deadiron</a>,
            a melodic thrash metal band. Building something creative with a small group, where everyone has to be
            fully invested or the whole thing falls apart, turned out to be a pretty good model for what a
            high-functioning team actually looks like — long before I was leading one professionally.
          </p>
          <p>
            Then a decade of software engineering, across finance at PNC Bank, HR tech at Arcoro, and now
            AI-native product work at Verifiable. Different industries, same pattern each time: modernize the
            solution, build a team that actually collaborates, and level up the organization's engineering
            practices so every person on it can contribute and grow — not just the senior few.
          </p>
          <p>
            Imagile exists because of a gap I kept seeing from the inside of those companies: the distance between
            the people building enterprise software and the people who have to use it. Big consultancies close that
            gap with headcount and process. I wanted to close it by staying small — one expert, hands-on, doing the
            work instead of managing the people who do it. Not thought leadership. Practical work, written up
            honestly, including what didn't work.
          </p>
        </Prose>

        <div class="about__credentials" data-reveal>
          <img src="/profile-pic.png" alt="Sunny Kolattukudy, founder of Imagile" class="about__photo" />
          <div>
            <p class="about__cred-line">
              Staff-level engineer. 10+ years in .NET and C#, Blazor WASM, and Angular.
            </p>
            <p class="about__cred-line">
              Based in Lewis Center, Ohio — Columbus metro. On-site in Central Ohio and remote everywhere else,
              equally first-class; remote isn't a fallback tier here.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CtaBand
      title="Talk it through — no pitch deck required."
      body="A strategy intensive is three hours and $900. If it's not a fit, I'll tell you that too."
    />
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about__credentials {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: flex-start;
    max-width: var(--measure);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .about__photo {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    flex: none;
  }

  .about__cred-line {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .about__cred-line + .about__cred-line { margin-top: 0.6rem; }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .about__credentials { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>
